    </div>

    <div class="controls-info">
        <strong>LOBBY:</strong><br>
        WASD to Move<br>
        F to Shop<br>
        Stand in Ring Corner to Fight<br><br>
        <strong>COMBAT (FIRST TO 3):</strong><br>
        WASD: Move<br>
        J: Light Jab<br>
        K: Heavy Hook<br>
        L (Hold): Block (Heals 1 HP/s)<br>
